  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am Mia. Today is Toy Day. It is a lesson at school. We stand in a line. My toy is in my bag. Teacher Kim says, \"Listen, please.\" \"Show your toy,\" she says.",
      "I have a red plane. It is small. It has a white line. Leo has a yellow motorbike. It is big. Leo has a funny hat. Ben has a black robot. It has two blue eyes. \"Is your robot new?\" asks Leo. \"Yes, it is,\" says Ben.",
      "Sam has a long train. It is green. May has a pink helicopter. \"Can your plane fly?\" asks Leo. \"Yes, it can!\" I say. I run with my plane. Teacher Kim smiles. \"Good toys!\" she says. I like this lesson."
    ],
    "summary": "Mia tells us about Toy Day in her class. Each child shows a toy, and Mia says its color and size.",
